exit: 0
--- stdout
aethyme broker — coordinate concurrent AI agent sessions on this repository

Usage: aethyme broker <verb> [args...]

Verbs:
  start     create an isolated worktree + session, or adopt/reuse an existing one
  status    sessions, overlaps, queue and integration; readiness and doctor views
  submit    simulate, gate and promote a session; preparation and promotion recovery
  finish    close sessions; reclaim ignored build output or clean up retained checkouts
  unblock   list current blockers, or clear one by id
  gc        reviewed plan/apply cleanup: retention, build output, storage, resources

Everything else (leases, git, gh, ship, review, operations, exec, ...):
  aethyme broker advanced --help

Run `aethyme broker <verb> --help` for a verb's forms and flags.
Overlaps warn — they never block (v0 policy).
--- stderr
